      "label": "ORRERY",
      "prompt": "PRESS E TO LOOK",
      "dialog": "A BRASS SUN, WARM TO THE TOUCH, AND SEVEN WORLDS TURNING ROUND IT ON THEIR ARMS: A GREEN SEA, A CITY LIT ALL NIGHT, A RINGED GIANT, A DARK DISC THAT EATS THE LAMPLIGHT, A QUILT OF FIELDS, A WHITE ONE, A FOREST.\n\nTHE SEVEN YOUR SHIP KNOWS. THE BRASS IS OLD. SHE KNEW THEM FIRST."
