      "dialog": "THE LONG TELESCOPE, AIMED OUT OF THE SLIT AT A PATCH OF SKY WITH NOTHING IN IT.\n\nYOU LOOK, AND THERE IS SOMETHING IN IT: A STAR THAT BLINKS THREE LONG, ONE SHORT. THEN NOT."
    },
    {
