      "dialog": "MORWEN'S CHARTS OF THE SKY OVER MIDNIGHT, NIGHT BY NIGHT FOR FORTY YEARS. ONE STAR IS INKED IN RED ON EVERY PAGE, AND ON EVERY PAGE IT HAS MOVED A LITTLE CLOSER TO THE ISLE."
    },
    {
      "x": 2,
      "y": 7,
